# Local env files.
#
# `*.env` was here and it does not do this job: it matches "production.env"
# and not ".env" itself, which is the one that actually holds the keys - so
# the file sat tracked in the repo with the Firebase and Maps browser keys in
# it. Named outright now, both the file and its variants.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.env

